title: Preserve native deposit attribution during stale deletion cleanup

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |
    Prevent stale pallet-revive deletion queue entries from clearing native
    storage-deposit attribution belonging to a newer contract generation at
    the same address.

crates:
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: patch
